u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T14:18:52Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T14:36:48Z","body":"> #112334 should have fixed the same issue, no? (#112013 almost sounds like duplicate) That code is still there, is it needed after your fix? The condition is almost the same too.\r\n\r\nConfirmed still reproducible on current master (which includes #112334).\r\n\r\nThe two PRs fix different code paths in the same function. #112334 fixes the else if branch that handles nodes which have their own scene_file_path set (i.e., instanced scene roots). This PR fixes the if branch that handles nodes whose scene_file_path is empty (like a CollisionShape3D inside the instanced scene). In that case, get_owner() returns the child scene's root node, whose path points to the child scene — making the newly created resource appear \"foreign\" to the edited scene and locking it as read-only. Both fixes are needed to fully cover the editable children case.\r\n\r\nUsing the original repo the child of the Area3D is still read only in latest master \r\n<img width=\"1916\" height=\"692\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ff73e3b-ccc2-43b2-abd0-834b5ae467b0\" />\r\n\r\nMy PR\r\n<img width=\"1913\" height=\"492\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdd63c7c-91fa-4e6d-8b09-71a7d778b155\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4082922697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743507104","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117220#issuecomment-4743507104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117220","id":4743507104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGrwsoA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:44Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4743507104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"